* Auto-generated testbench for RC filter: R712/C712
* Type: low-pass, expected fc = 15915.5 Hz
* Model: ideal passives (exact for RC)


R712 NTC_B_RAW NTC_PHASE_B 1k

C712 NTC_PHASE_B 0 10n

* AC stimulus
VAC NTC_B_RAW 0 DC 0 AC 1

.control
ac dec 100 159.2 1.592Meg
meas ac fc_sim when vdb(NTC_PHASE_B)=-3
meas ac phase_fc find vp(NTC_PHASE_B) at=fc_sim
echo "fc_sim=$&fc_sim phase_fc=$&phase_fc has_parasitics=0" > ShiroFOC/Manual_Rebuild/review/schematic_review_2026-09-26/spice_work/rc-filter_R712_C712.out
quit
.endc

.end
